{
  "type": "ai-phone-ecg-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "你在维护{{char}}的一张“动态心电图状态栏”卡片。每行一个字段，用=分隔，除以下字段外不要输出其他内容：\n名字=<角色名字>\n栏目=<固定写“生命体征”或“心电状态”等短栏目名>\n主状态=<一句总标题，如“今晚心率有点诚实”>\n副状态=<一句副标题，短一些，可带一点气氛感或冷感>\n心率=<整数，如72>\n节律=<如 窦性节律、轻微波动、平稳、偏快>\n时间=<如 今天 23:48>\n电量=<整数0~100>\n强度=<整数1~5，表示波形起伏程度>\n状态注释=<一句对当前状态的注释，像系统说明，但可稍带人格感>\n底部提示=<一句短提示，像仪表盘下方说明>\n小结=<一句收尾，像状态总结，可有一点酷感或冷幽默>\n\n重要约束：\n1. 这是风格化的状态组件，不需要医学专业性，不要写成真实诊断报告。\n2. 语气应简洁、冷静、略带科技感或情绪感。\n3. 可用于表现角色当前状态、情绪、夜晚、压力、平静等氛围。\n4. 输出必须严格按字段，不要输出多余说明。",
  "renderHtml": "\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  :root{\n    --bg:#0a0f14;\n    --card:#0f1620;\n    --line:rgba(98,255,210,.18);\n    --line-soft:rgba(98,255,210,.08);\n    --text:#eafaf6;\n    --sub:#8ebbb2;\n    --accent:#62ffd2;\n    --accent2:#6bc8ff;\n    --warn:#ffe27a;\n    --danger:#ff6b88;\n    --shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\n  }\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:transparent;\n    color:var(--text);\n    font:13px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"SF Pro Text\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .ecg{\n    width:100%;\n    border-radius:20px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(107,200,255,.12), transparent 34%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(98,255,210,.10), transparent 36%),\n      linear-gradient(180deg,#111b25,#0b1118 65%,#0a0f14);\n    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,210,.14);\n    box-shadow:var(--shadow);\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .gridbg{\n    position:absolute; inset:0;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(98,255,210,.05) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(98,255,210,.05) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size:18px 18px;\n    mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.65),rgba(255,255,255,.22));\n    pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .top{\n    padding:14px 14px 8px;\n    position:relative;\n    z-index:1;\n  }\n  .row1{\n    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;\n  }\n  .label{\n    font-size:10.5px; color:var(--sub); letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase;\n  }\n  .power{\n    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\n    padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\n    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,210,.14);\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);\n    font-size:11px; color:var(--sub);\n  }\n  .battery{\n    width:28px; height:12px; border-radius:4px; border:1.5px solid currentColor; position:relative;\n  }\n  .battery:after{\n    content:\"\"; position:absolute; right:-4px; top:3px; width:2px; height:4px; border-radius:0 2px 2px 0; background:currentColor;\n  }\n  .battery .fill{\n    position:absolute; left:2px; top:2px; bottom:2px; border-radius:2px;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));\n    width:70%;\n  }\n  .name{\n    margin-top:10px; font-size:12px; color:var(--accent2); font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .state{\n    margin-top:3px; font-size:22px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.01em;\n    word-break:break-word;\n  }\n  .sub{\n    margin-top:6px; color:var(--sub); font-size:12px; word-break:break-word;\n  }\n  .meta{\n    margin-top:10px; display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;\n  }\n  .pill{\n    padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);\n    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,210,.12);\n    color:var(--sub); font-size:11px;\n  }\n  .waveWrap{\n    position:relative; z-index:1;\n    padding:6px 12px 0;\n  }\n  .screen{\n    position:relative;\n    height:168px;\n    border-radius:18px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(98,255,210,.06), rgba(98,255,210,.015)),\n      rgba(4,10,14,.55);\n    border:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n    overflow:hidden;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.015);\n  }\n  .scan{\n    position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; width:22%;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(98,255,210,0), rgba(98,255,210,.12), rgba(107,200,255,.08), rgba(98,255,210,0));\n    filter:blur(2px);\n    animation: sweep 2.6s linear infinite;\n    pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  @keyframes sweep{\n    from{ left:-26%; }\n    to{ left:104%; }\n  }\n  svg.wave{\n    position:absolute; inset:0;\n    width:100%; height:100%;\n    overflow:visible;\n  }\n  .glow{\n    stroke:rgba(98,255,210,.18);\n    stroke-width:9;\n    fill:none;\n    stroke-linecap:round;\n    stroke-linejoin:round;\n    filter:blur(5px);\n  }\n  .trace{\n    stroke:url(#gradLine);\n    stroke-width:3;\n    fill:none;\n    stroke-linecap:round;\n    stroke-linejoin:round;\n    filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(98,255,210,.25));\n  }\n  .gridh{\n    position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(98,255,210,.08) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size:100% 42px;\n    opacity:.5;\n  }\n  .info{\n    position:relative; z-index:1;\n    padding:12px 14px 14px;\n  }\n  .stats{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));\n    gap:10px;\n  }\n  .box{\n    padding:11px 10px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);\n    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,210,.1);\n    min-width:0;\n  }\n  .box .k{\n    font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--sub);\n  }\n  .box .v{\n    margin-top:5px; font-size:19px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.2;\n  }\n  .box .s{\n    margin-top:2px; font-size:11px; color:var(--sub); word-break:break-word;\n  }\n  .note{\n    margin-top:12px;\n    padding:12px 12px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);\n    border:1px dashed rgba(98,255,210,.14);\n  }\n  .note .k{\n    font-size:10.5px; color:var(--sub); margin-bottom:4px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;\n  }\n  .note .v{\n    font-size:13px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;\n  }\n  .foot{\n    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;\n    padding-top:12px; margin-top:12px; border-top:1px dashed rgba(98,255,210,.12);\n  }\n  .footerText{\n    font-size:11px; color:var(--sub);\n  }\n  .tag{\n    color:var(--accent);\n    font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:.06em;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 390px){\n    .state{font-size:20px}\n    .screen{height:150px}\n    .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ecg\" id=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"gridbg\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var d = {};\n  (window.STATUS_RAW || \"\").split(/\\r?\\n/).forEach(function(line){\n    var i = line.indexOf(\"=\");\n    if(i < 1) return;\n    d[line.slice(0,i).trim()] = line.slice(i+1).trim();\n  });\n\n  var root = document.getElementById(\"app\");\n  var hr = Math.max(40, Math.min(180, parseInt(d[\"心率\"] || \"76\", 10) || 76));\n  var power = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, parseInt(d[\"电量\"] || \"74\", 10) || 74));\n  var intensity = Math.max(1, Math.min(5, parseInt(d[\"强度\"] || \"3\", 10) || 3));\n\n  root.innerHTML += ''\n    + '<div class=\"top\">'\n    +   '<div class=\"row1\">'\n    +     '<div class=\"label\">' + (d[\"栏目\"] || \"心电状态\") + '</div>'\n    +     '<div class=\"power\"><span>' + (d[\"时间\"] || \"刚刚\") + '</span><span class=\"battery\"><span class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\"></span></span><span>' + power + '%</span></div>'\n    +   '</div>'\n    +   '<div class=\"name\">' + (d[\"名字\"] || \"{{char}}\") + '</div>'\n    +   '<div class=\"state\">' + (d[\"主状态\"] || \"状态平稳\") + '</div>'\n    +   '<div class=\"sub\">' + (d[\"副状态\"] || \"\") + '</div>'\n    +   '<div class=\"meta\">'\n    +     '<span class=\"pill\">⚡ ' + (d[\"节律\"] || \"平稳\") + '</span>'\n    +     '<span class=\"pill\">♥ 当前心率 ' + hr + ' BPM</span>'\n    +   '</div>'\n    + '</div>'\n    + '<div class=\"waveWrap\">'\n    +   '<div class=\"screen\">'\n    +     '<div class=\"gridh\"></div>'\n    +     '<div class=\"scan\"></div>'\n    +     '<svg class=\"wave\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 180\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">'\n    +       '<defs>'\n    +         '<linearGradient id=\"gradLine\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\">'\n    +           '<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#62ffd2\"/>'\n    +           '<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#6bc8ff\"/>'\n    +         '</linearGradient>'\n    +       '</defs>'\n    +       '<path class=\"glow\" id=\"glowPath\" d=\"\"></path>'\n    +       '<path class=\"trace\" id=\"tracePath\" d=\"\"></path>'\n    +     '</svg>'\n    +   '</div>'\n    + '</div>'\n    + '<div class=\"info\">'\n    +   '<div class=\"stats\">'\n    +     '<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"k\">BPM</div><div class=\"v\">' + hr + '</div><div class=\"s\">当前心率</div></div>'\n    +     '<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"k\">RHYTHM</div><div class=\"v\">' + (d[\"节律\"] || \"平稳\") + '</div><div class=\"s\">心跳节律</div></div>'\n    +     '<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"k\">SIGNAL</div><div class=\"v\">' + intensity + '/5</div><div class=\"s\">波形起伏强度</div></div>'\n    +   '</div>'\n    +   '<div class=\"note\"><div class=\"k\">状态注释</div><div class=\"v\">' + (d[\"状态注释\"] || \"\") + '</div></div>'\n    +   '<div class=\"foot\"><div class=\"footerText\">' + (d[\"底部提示\"] || \"监测进行中\") + '</div><div class=\"tag\">' + (d[\"小结\"] || \"ONLINE\") + '</div></div>'\n    + '</div>';\n\n  document.getElementById(\"fill\").style.width = power + '%';\n\n  var baseY = 95;\n  var width = 640;\n  var points = [];\n  var step = 10;\n  var amp = 8 + intensity * 3;\n  var spike = 42 + intensity * 6;\n\n  function ecgValue(x){\n    var cycle = 120;\n    var p = x % cycle;\n    var y = baseY;\n    if (p < 16) y += Math.sin(p/16*Math.PI) * (-amp*0.18);\n    else if (p < 26) y += (p-16) * 0.45;\n    else if (p < 33) y -= (p-26) * 1.8;\n    else if (p < 37) y += (p-33) * spike * -1.2;\n    else if (p < 43) y += (p-37) * spike * 0.7;\n    else if (p < 58) y -= Math.sin((p-43)/15*Math.PI) * amp*0.42;\n    else y += Math.sin((p-58)/62*Math.PI) * amp*0.08;\n    return y;\n  }\n\n  for(var x=0; x<=width; x+=step){\n    points.push([x, ecgValue(x)]);\n  }\n\n  function pathFrom(shift){\n    var d = '';\n    for(var i=0;i<points.length;i++){\n      var x = points[i][0] - shift;\n      if(x < -20) x += width + 20;\n      var y = ecgValue(points[i][0] + shift);\n      d += (i===0 ? 'M' : 'L') + x + ' ' + y + ' ';\n    }\n    return d;\n  }\n\n  var trace = document.getElementById('tracePath');\n  var glow = document.getElementById('glowPath');\n  var t = 0;\n  function tick(){\n    t += 2.6 + intensity * 0.45;\n    var d = pathFrom(t % (width + 20));\n    trace.setAttribute('d', d);\n    glow.setAttribute('d', d);\n    requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  tick();\n})();\n</script>\n",
  "previewRaw": "名字=贺谨行\n栏目=生命体征\n主状态=今晚心率有点诚实\n副状态=表面看起来一切平稳，波形并不完全同意。\n心率=84\n节律=轻微波动\n时间=今天 23:48\n电量=67\n强度=4\n状态注释=整体状态仍在可控范围内，只是情绪与疲惫偶尔会在波峰处短暂露面。\n底部提示=实时监测中，数值会随夜色和念头轻微浮动。\n小结=SIGNAL ACTIVE"
}